WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.945
Miss Gray: Our pictures are here, class.

2
00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:14.737
Daisy: Uh-oh.

3
00:00:14.738 --> 00:00:17.070
Mark: How does our class picture look?

4
00:00:17.071 --> 00:00:22.477
Miss Gray: Um . . .

5
00:00:22.478 --> 00:00:24.208
Coby: Oh boy.

6
00:00:24.209 --> 00:00:25.938
Maya: Not good.

7
00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:29.674
Eve: I really wanted a nice class picture.

8
00:00:29.675 --> 00:00:31.874
Jim: Me too.

9
00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:35.097
Daisy: It's my fault. And Kara's.

10
00:00:35.098 --> 00:00:37.836
Kara: I didn't do anything.

11
00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:42.337
Daisy: Yes, you did. You were saying mean things to me!

12
00:00:42.338 --> 00:00:45.719
Kara: Well, you should blame Mark, not me.

13
00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:49.939
Kara: He's the one who spilled juice on you!

14
00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.450
Miss Gray: Okay, girls, that's enough.

15
00:00:52.451 --> 00:00:54.959
Miss Gray: Class, please put the pictures away.

16
00:00:54.960 --> 00:01:02.640
Miss Gray: It's time to go home.

17
00:01:02.641 --> 00:01:05.636
Daisy: Your dad is the best at cleaning clothes, Jenna.

18
00:01:05.637 --> 00:01:09.680
Jenna: That's why he owns a laundry business, I guess.

19
00:01:09.681 --> 00:01:12.465
Jenna: I'm glad all the juice stains came out.

20
00:01:12.466 --> 00:01:14.345
Daisy: Me too.

21
00:01:14.346 --> 00:01:19.716
Jenna: But why did Miss Gray tell us to wear our Picture Day clothes again?

22
00:01:19.717 --> 00:01:30.370
Daisy: I don't know.

23
00:01:30.371 --> 00:01:33.445
Daisy: Look! Monster Mark is back.

24
00:01:33.446 --> 00:01:38.907
Daisy: Ah! Don't come near me!

25
00:01:38.908 --> 00:01:43.275
Miss Gray: I have good news, class.

26
00:01:43.276 --> 00:01:45.615
Miss Gray: It's Picture Day again.

27
00:01:45.616 --> 00:01:47.294
Class: What?

28
00:01:47.295 --> 00:01:49.752
Daisy: What do you mean, Miss Gray?

29
00:01:49.753 --> 00:01:53.347
Miss Gray: The photographer is coming back at ten o'clock.

30
00:01:53.348 --> 00:01:55.957
Miss Gray: He's going to take our picture again.

31
00:01:55.958 --> 00:01:59.274
Miss Gray: Maybe this one will come out better.

32
00:01:59.275 --> 00:02:03.892
Class: Hooray!

33
00:02:03.893 --> 00:02:06.788
Daisy: I won't make a mean face this time.

34
00:02:06.789 --> 00:02:08.602
Kara: Me neither.

35
00:02:08.603 --> 00:02:10.954
Photographer: Okay, Room Two.

36
00:02:10.955 --> 00:02:14.605
Photographer: On the count of three, say "Cheese."

37
00:02:14.606 --> 00:02:18.823
Photographer: One . . . Two . . . Three!

38
00:02:18.824 --> 00:02:26.653
Class: Cheese!
